\paragraph{Real-world results.} \Cref{fig:real} reports 20 trials per task. On seen tasks, LLM-backbone methods outperform RT-1 and Diffusion Policy, with UP-VLA competitive or best. On unseen-object grasping, UP-VLA-RT-2 beats UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu, consistent with semantics coming from MMU, while UP-VLA is best overall. On precision tasks the order reverses: UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu beats UP-VLA-RT-2, showing the value of future prediction for spatial detail, and UP-VLA is again best.

